# Nanopb options for AAP Protobufs: static arrays and strings
* max_size: 64
* max_count: 8

*ServiceDiscoveryResponse.channels max_count: 10
*VideoConfiguration.codec_resolution type: FT_STATIC
*AudioConfiguration.sampling_rate type: FT_STATIC
*KeyBindingResponse.keycodes max_count: 16
*TouchAction.action type: FT_STATIC
